From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:12:46 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 60/60] Lanes keyed sampler: no full-vocabulary sort when
 nothing is cut by rank (top_k off or >= width, top_p off): one pass over the
 row (Muse's draw hands it the f32 row, no f64 copies), the same Gumbel race
 in id order with the sorted order's tie rule, candidates whose noise provably
 cannot reach the best score skipped before the logs; the same token as before
 (chooseSorted kept as the reference and the top_k/top_p path; tests against
 it and against Muse's old draw)

